OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners to fight plans for 700
OL,4,Ahouses on greenbelt
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have launched a campaign to
OL,7,Foppose the development of more than 700
OL,8,Fhomes on greenbelt land in south
OL,9,FKenilworth.
OL,11,FProposals for multiple areas of land
OL,12,Fare being considered as part of the
OL,13,FSouth Warwickshire Local Plan, Warwick
OL,14,FDistrict Council confirmed.
OL,16,FCatesby Estates is handling proposals
OL,17,Fwest of Rouncil Lane and said it was
OL,18,F"appropriate to explore" whether the
OL,19,Fsites met local housing needs.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
